# Everything by default: the build stage COPYs the few paths it needs by name
# (package.json, the lockfile, the workspace file, tsconfig, build.config.ts and
# src/), so anything not listed below cannot reach the build context at all.
#
# Deny-by-default rather than a list of exclusions, because the failure modes of
# the other order are silent: a host `node_modules` shadowing the one the image
# installs, a stale `dist/` shipped instead of the one just built, a `.env` or a
# state directory baked into a layer.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!patches
!tsconfig.json
!build.config.ts
!src
